@startuml LocalLibraryPart1_Sequence
title KnowledgeOS — 28-LocalLibraryPart1 — Execution Sequence
actor Consumer
participant "Application Service" as App
participant "Domain Rules" as Domain
participant "Repository/Port" as Port
participant "Event/Outbox" as Events
Consumer -> App: request(context, input)
App -> App: normalize + validate
App -> Port: load required state
Port --> App: state/version
App -> Domain: plan transition
Domain --> App: validated plan
App -> Port: persist/execute(plan)
Port --> App: durable result
App -> Events: append event if applicable
App --> Consumer: stable response
@enduml
